      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Oh, so this request has been around for a while. I was thinking the same thing the other day. I found this page so I'm leaving a comment. The sticker feature is really fun, and some stickers become even more interesting when combined with stickers placed by other users. For example, hand stickers. However, if you save the left and right variations every time, all 18 slots will always be filled. This is useful in terms of reducing the number of slots.",
